{
  "esm": "0.8.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "ISRM",
    "description": "InMAP ISRM (v1.2.1) source-receptor air-pollution computation expressed in EarthSciAST 0.8.0, reproducing the InMAP ISRM tutorial (https://inmap.run/blog/2022/12/15/tutorial/). EGU point-source emissions from the EPA 2016fd FF10 point inventory are Lambert-Conformal-Conic projected onto the ISRM grid (NEI2016 params lat_1=33, lat_2=45, lat_0=40, lon_0=-97, R=6370997) and spatially joined (axis-aligned rectangle containment) to source cells, then binned per pathway into E_p on the compact emission-bearing source-cell axis. The five source-receptor matrices (SOA<-VOC, pNO3<-NOx, pNH4<-NH3, pSO4<-SOx, PrimaryPM25<-PM2_5) are contracted against E_p over the source axis to give per-receptor concentrations, summed and unit-scaled (fact=28766.639) to TotalPM25, and turned into Krewski (RR 1.06) and Lepeule (RR 1.14) attributable deaths using the tutorial's population/mortality prefix-slice [0:52411] and 2010->2016 / 2005->2016 rescalings. Two-stage runner-mediated pipeline: the .esm carries all the MATH; the runner binds the zarr/ff10 providers (format is set at provider creation, not in the .esm source schema), computes the data-dependent unique emission-bearing source-cell set `ppl` from the spatial join, and threads it into the SR provider's lazy orthogonal select SR[layer0, ppl, :] so the SR params arrive pre-sliced as the compact [emis_src_cells, rcv_cells] slab (no 330 GB fold). See metadata.x_esd on each loader and the SR_*/ppl parameter descriptions for the exact runner-mediated bindings and format gaps (G1/G2/G3/G5/G6).",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML"
    ],
    "license": "MIT",
    "created": "2026-07-19T00:00:00Z",
    "tags": [
      "isrm",
      "inmap",
      "source_receptor",
      "air_quality",
      "pm25",
      "health_impact",
      "emissions",
      "ff10",
      "nei2016",
      "zarr",
      "lambert_conformal",
      "reprojection",
      "data_loader",
      "variable_map",
      "referenced-component"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Tessum, C.W., Hill, J.D., Marshall, J.D. (2017). InMAP: A model for air pollution interventions. PLoS ONE 12(4): e0176131.",
        "doi": "10.1371/journal.pone.0176131"
      },
      {
        "citation": "InMAP ISRM tutorial (2022-12-15).",
        "url": "https://inmap.run/blog/2022/12/15/tutorial/"
      }
    ],
    "x_esd": {
      "note": "Two-stage runner-orchestrated pipeline (see wave3 design decisions). Stage 1 (runner): ff10 EGU ingest -> LCC project + rectangle spatial join -> ppl (unique emission-bearing source cells) + compact E_p; bind zarr SR provider with lazy select ([0], ppl, :). Stage 2: static evaluation of the observeds below. Expected national totals: ~7,525 deaths (Krewski) / ~16,979 deaths (Lepeule).",
      "format_gaps": {
        "G1": "0.8.0 source schema has no `format` field / no .zarray pinning; recorded in loader x_esd.",
        "G2": "No lazy source-dim selection in-format; SR[layer0, ppl, :] select is runner-mediated (see SR_* params + ppl).",
        "G3": "No FF10/zip semantics in-format; member filter + column map recorded in EGU_Emis x_esd, pollutant->pathway map expressed as enum/ifelse observeds.",
        "G5": "No polygon/choropleth plot type; best available is a centroid scatter (see examples).",
        "G6": "N_REC / N_PPL are runtime-discovered metaparameters (default 0)."
      }
    }
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "N_SRC": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 52411,
      "description": "ISRM source cells (first-52411 coarse subset of the InMAP grid)."
    },
    "N_RCV": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 52411,
      "description": "ISRM receptor cells (== the source grid, same ordered cell set)."
    },
    "N_POP": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 596444,
      "description": "Full InMAP grid length of W/S/E/N/TotalPop/MortalityRate."
    },
    "N_LAYER": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 3,
      "description": "SR emission layers (only layer 0 is used)."
    },
    "N_REC": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "EGU FF10 point-source record count (runtime-discovered; G6)."
    },
    "N_PPL": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "Count of unique emission-bearing source cells len(ppl); runtime-discovered from the spatial join (G2/G6). Sizes the compact emis_src_cells axis on which the pre-sliced SR slab is delivered."
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "src_cells": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "N_SRC"
    },
    "rcv_cells": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "N_RCV"
    },
    "pop_cells": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "N_POP"
    },
    "emis_layer": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "N_LAYER"
    },
    "pathways": {
      "kind": "categorical",
      "members": [
        "SOA",
        "pNO3",
        "pNH4",
        "pSO4",
        "PrimaryPM25"
      ]
    },
    "emis_records": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "N_REC"
    },
    "emis_src_cells": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "N_PPL"
    }
  },
  "data_loaders": {
    "ISRM_SR": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "s3://inmap-model/isrm_v1.2.1.zarr/"
      },
      "reference": {
        "url": "https://inmap.run/blog/2022/12/15/tutorial/",
        "notes": "InMAP ISRM v1.2.1 zarr store on the inmap-model S3 bucket."
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "isrm",
          "source_receptor",
          "air_quality",
          "zarr",
          "health"
        ],
        "x_esd": {
          "format": "zarr",
          "zarr_format": 2,
          "consolidated": false,
          "sr_dim_order": [
            "emisLayer",
            "source",
            "receptor"
          ],
          "arrays": {
            "SOA": {
              "shape": [
                3,
                52411,
                52411
              ],
              "chunks": [
                1,
                100,
                52411
              ],
              "dtype": "<f4",
              "compressor": "blosc:lz4:clevel5:shuffle1",
              "fill": 0.0,
              "order": "C"
            },
            "pNO3": {
              "shape": [
                3,
                52411,
                52411
              ],
              "chunks": [
                1,
                100,
                52411
              ],
              "dtype": "<f4"
            },
            "pNH4": {
              "shape": [
                3,
                52411,
                52411
              ],
              "chunks": [
                1,
                100,
                52411
              ],
              "dtype": "<f4"
            },
            "pSO4": {
              "shape": [
                3,
                52411,
                52411
              ],
              "chunks": [
                1,
                100,
                52411
              ],
              "dtype": "<f4"
            },
            "PrimaryPM25": {
              "shape": [
                3,
                52411,
                52411
              ],
              "chunks": [
                1,
                100,
                52411
              ],
              "dtype": "<f4"
            },
            "TotalPop": {
              "shape": [
                596444
              ],
              "chunks": [
                596444
              ],
              "dtype": "<f8"
            },
            "MortalityRate": {
              "shape": [
                596444
              ],
              "chunks": [
                596444
              ],
              "dtype": "<f8"
            },
            "W": {
              "shape": [
                596444
              ],
              "chunks": [
                596444
              ],
              "dtype": "<f8"
            },
            "S": {
              "shape": [
                596444
              ],
              "chunks": [
                596444
              ],
              "dtype": "<f8"
            },
            "E": {
              "shape": [
                596444
              ],
              "chunks": [
                596444
              ],
              "dtype": "<f8"
            },
            "N": {
              "shape": [
                596444
              ],
              "chunks": [
                596444
              ],
              "dtype": "<f8"
            }
          },
          "lazy_select": {
            "SOA": "get_orthogonal_selection(([0], ppl, slice(None)))",
            "pNO3": "get_orthogonal_selection(([0], ppl, slice(None)))",
            "pNH4": "get_orthogonal_selection(([0], ppl, slice(None)))",
            "pSO4": "get_orthogonal_selection(([0], ppl, slice(None)))",
            "PrimaryPM25": "get_orthogonal_selection(([0], ppl, slice(None)))"
          },
          "note": "`format`, the pinned .zarray params, and the lazy ppl select are not expressible in the 0.8.0 source schema (G1/G2); the runner sets format at provider creation and threads the computed `ppl` into the select before the SR contraction. W/S/E/N/TotalPop/MortalityRate are read fully; the first 52411 (the [0:52411] prefix slice) are the SR receptor/source cells."
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "SOA": {
          "file_variable": "SOA",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "description": "SR secondary organic aerosol response (contracted with VOC emissions). SR response; native dims [emis_layer, src_cells, rcv_cells] (dtype <f4, chunks [1,100,52411]). Runner delivers only the lazy orthogonal slice ([0], ppl, :) => the compact [emis_src_cells, rcv_cells] slab (G2)."
        },
        "pNO3": {
          "file_variable": "pNO3",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "description": "SR particulate nitrate response (contracted with NOx emissions). SR response; native dims [emis_layer, src_cells, rcv_cells] (dtype <f4, chunks [1,100,52411]). Runner delivers only the lazy orthogonal slice ([0], ppl, :) => the compact [emis_src_cells, rcv_cells] slab (G2)."
        },
        "pNH4": {
          "file_variable": "pNH4",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "description": "SR particulate ammonium response (contracted with NH3 emissions). SR response; native dims [emis_layer, src_cells, rcv_cells] (dtype <f4, chunks [1,100,52411]). Runner delivers only the lazy orthogonal slice ([0], ppl, :) => the compact [emis_src_cells, rcv_cells] slab (G2)."
        },
        "pSO4": {
          "file_variable": "pSO4",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "description": "SR particulate sulfate response (contracted with SOx emissions). SR response; native dims [emis_layer, src_cells, rcv_cells] (dtype <f4, chunks [1,100,52411]). Runner delivers only the lazy orthogonal slice ([0], ppl, :) => the compact [emis_src_cells, rcv_cells] slab (G2)."
        },
        "PrimaryPM25": {
          "file_variable": "PrimaryPM25",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "description": "SR primary PM2.5 response (contracted with PM2_5 emissions). SR response; native dims [emis_layer, src_cells, rcv_cells] (dtype <f4, chunks [1,100,52411]). Runner delivers only the lazy orthogonal slice ([0], ppl, :) => the compact [emis_src_cells, rcv_cells] slab (G2)."
        },
        "W": {
          "file_variable": "W",
          "units": "m",
          "description": "Cell west edge (LCC metres); length 596444, first 52411 build the cell rectangles."
        },
        "S": {
          "file_variable": "S",
          "units": "m",
          "description": "Cell south edge (LCC metres); length 596444, first 52411 used."
        },
        "E": {
          "file_variable": "E",
          "units": "m",
          "description": "Cell east edge (LCC metres); length 596444, first 52411 used."
        },
        "N": {
          "file_variable": "N",
          "units": "m",
          "description": "Cell north edge (LCC metres); length 596444, first 52411 used."
        },
        "TotalPop": {
          "file_variable": "TotalPop",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Population per cell; length 596444, prefix [0:52411] used in the deaths formula."
        },
        "MortalityRate": {
          "file_variable": "MortalityRate",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Baseline all-cause mortality per 100,000; length 596444, prefix [0:52411] used."
        }
      }
    },
    "EGU_Emis": {
      "kind": "points",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "ftp://newftp.epa.gov/air/emismod/2016/alpha/2016fd/emissions/2016fd_inputs_point.zip"
      },
      "reference": {
        "notes": "EPA 2016fd alpha point-source FF10 inventory (2016fd_inputs_point.zip)."
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "nei",
          "ff10",
          "point_sources",
          "egu",
          "emissions"
        ],
        "x_esd": {
          "format": "ff10",
          "container": "zip",
          "member_filter": "*egu*",
          "crs": "EPSG:4269",
          "columns": {
            "pollutant": 12,
            "annual_tons": 13,
            "stkhgt_ft": 17,
            "stkdiam_ft": 18,
            "stktemp_F": 19,
            "stkvel_fps": 21,
            "lon": 23,
            "lat": 24
          },
          "pollutant_encoding": "The FF10 col-12 string code is delivered as the integer in `pollutant_codes` by the runner ff10 reader; the is_VOC/is_NOx/is_NH3/is_SOx/is_PM25 membership observeds compare `pollutant` against these integers (STEP 0.6 pollutant->pathway map).",
          "pollutant_codes": {
            "VOC": 1,
            "VOC_INV": 2,
            "XYL": 3,
            "TOL": 4,
            "TERP": 5,
            "PAR": 6,
            "OLE": 7,
            "NVOL": 8,
            "MEOH": 9,
            "ISOP": 10,
            "IOLE": 11,
            "FORM": 12,
            "ETOH": 13,
            "ETHA": 14,
            "ETH": 15,
            "ALD2": 16,
            "ALDX": 17,
            "CB05_ALD2": 18,
            "CB05_ALDX": 19,
            "CB05_BENZENE": 20,
            "CB05_ETH": 21,
            "CB05_ETHA": 22,
            "CB05_ETOH": 23,
            "CB05_FORM": 24,
            "CB05_IOLE": 25,
            "CB05_ISOP": 26,
            "CB05_MEOH": 27,
            "CB05_OLE": 28,
            "CB05_PAR": 29,
            "CB05_TERP": 30,
            "CB05_TOL": 31,
            "CB05_XYL": 32,
            "ETHANOL": 33,
            "NHTOG": 34,
            "NMOG": 35,
            "NOX": 36,
            "HONO": 37,
            "NO": 38,
            "NO2": 39,
            "NH3": 40,
            "SO2": 41,
            "PM25-PRI": 42,
            "PM2_5": 43,
            "DIESEL-PM25": 44,
            "PAL": 45,
            "PCA": 46,
            "PCL": 47,
            "PEC": 48,
            "PFE": 49,
            "PK": 50,
            "PMG": 51,
            "PMN": 52,
            "PMOTHR": 53,
            "PNH4": 54,
            "PNO3": 55,
            "POC": 56,
            "PSI": 57,
            "PSO4": 58,
            "PTI": 59
          },
          "note": "format=ff10, the zip container, the *egu* member filter, and the numbered column map are not expressible in the 0.8.0 source schema (G3); the runner selects egu members and parses the columns. Records whose pollutant maps to no pathway are skipped by the runner."
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "pollutant": {
          "file_variable": "poll",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "FF10 pollutant code (col 12), delivered as the `pollutant` enum integer (see x_esd)."
        },
        "annual": {
          "file_variable": "ann_value",
          "units": "kg/yr",
          "description": "Annual emissions (col 13)."
        },
        "stkhgt": {
          "file_variable": "stkhgt",
          "units": "m",
          "unit_conversion": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "stkhgt",
              0.3048
            ]
          },
          "description": "Stack height (col 17), ft->m. Collected for fidelity; NOT consumed (emisLayer hard-coded to 0)."
        },
        "stkdiam": {
          "file_variable": "stkdiam",
          "units": "m",
          "unit_conversion": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "stkdiam",
              0.3048
            ]
          },
          "description": "Stack diameter (col 18), ft->m. Fidelity only; unused downstream."
        },
        "stktemp": {
          "file_variable": "stktemp",
          "units": "K",
          "unit_conversion": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "stktemp",
                      32
                    ]
                  },
                  0.5555555555555556
                ]
              },
              273.15
            ]
          },
          "description": "Stack temperature (col 19), degF->K (F-32)*5/9+273.15. Fidelity only; unused downstream."
        },
        "stkvel": {
          "file_variable": "stkvel",
          "units": "m/s",
          "unit_conversion": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "stkvel",
              0.3048
            ]
          },
          "description": "Stack velocity (col 21), ft/s->m/s. Fidelity only; unused downstream."
        },
        "lon": {
          "file_variable": "lon",
          "units": "degree",
          "description": "Longitude (col 23), EPSG:4269 treated as +proj=longlat."
        },
        "lat": {
          "file_variable": "lat",
          "units": "degree",
          "description": "Latitude (col 24), EPSG:4269 treated as +proj=longlat."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "ISRM": {
      "system_kind": "nonlinear",
      "reference": {
        "url": "https://inmap.run/blog/2022/12/15/tutorial/",
        "notes": "Pure algebraic (no ODE state); every result is an observed."
      },
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "../EarthSciDiscretizations/reprojection/lambert_conformal.esm"
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "SR_SOA": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_src_cells",
            "rcv_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Source-receptor matrix for the SOA pathway (contracted with VOC emissions), already emisLayer-0- and ppl-sliced by the runner's lazy zarr select ([0], ppl, :). Rows are the compact emission-bearing source cells (emis_src_cells), columns the 52411 receptors (rcv_cells). Wired from ISRM_SR.SOA via param_to_var (G2)."
        },
        "SR_pNO3": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_src_cells",
            "rcv_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Source-receptor matrix for the pNO3 pathway (contracted with NOx emissions), already emisLayer-0- and ppl-sliced by the runner's lazy zarr select ([0], ppl, :). Rows are the compact emission-bearing source cells (emis_src_cells), columns the 52411 receptors (rcv_cells). Wired from ISRM_SR.pNO3 via param_to_var (G2)."
        },
        "SR_pNH4": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_src_cells",
            "rcv_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Source-receptor matrix for the pNH4 pathway (contracted with NH3 emissions), already emisLayer-0- and ppl-sliced by the runner's lazy zarr select ([0], ppl, :). Rows are the compact emission-bearing source cells (emis_src_cells), columns the 52411 receptors (rcv_cells). Wired from ISRM_SR.pNH4 via param_to_var (G2)."
        },
        "SR_pSO4": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_src_cells",
            "rcv_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Source-receptor matrix for the pSO4 pathway (contracted with SOx emissions), already emisLayer-0- and ppl-sliced by the runner's lazy zarr select ([0], ppl, :). Rows are the compact emission-bearing source cells (emis_src_cells), columns the 52411 receptors (rcv_cells). Wired from ISRM_SR.pSO4 via param_to_var (G2)."
        },
        "SR_PrimaryPM25": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "ug/m^3/(kg/yr)",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_src_cells",
            "rcv_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Source-receptor matrix for the PrimaryPM25 pathway (contracted with PM2_5 emissions), already emisLayer-0- and ppl-sliced by the runner's lazy zarr select ([0], ppl, :). Rows are the compact emission-bearing source cells (emis_src_cells), columns the 52411 receptors (rcv_cells). Wired from ISRM_SR.PrimaryPM25 via param_to_var (G2)."
        },
        "emis_lon": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "degree",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_records"
          ],
          "description": "Emission-point longitude (EPSG:4269); from EGU_Emis.lon."
        },
        "emis_lat": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "degree",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_records"
          ],
          "description": "Emission-point latitude (EPSG:4269); from EGU_Emis.lat."
        },
        "emis_annual": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "kg/yr",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_records"
          ],
          "description": "Per-record annual emissions (tons/yr); from EGU_Emis.annual."
        },
        "pollutant": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_records"
          ],
          "description": "Per-record FF10 pollutant code as the `pollutant` enum integer; from EGU_Emis.pollutant."
        },
        "stkhgt": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_records"
          ],
          "description": "Stack height (m); from EGU_Emis.stkhgt. Fidelity only; ISRM never consumes it (emisLayer hard-coded to 0)."
        },
        "stkdiam": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_records"
          ],
          "description": "Stack diameter (m); from EGU_Emis.stkdiam. Fidelity only; unused."
        },
        "stktemp": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_records"
          ],
          "description": "Stack temperature (K); from EGU_Emis.stktemp. Fidelity only; unused."
        },
        "stkvel": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_records"
          ],
          "description": "Stack velocity (m/s); from EGU_Emis.stkvel. Fidelity only; unused."
        },
        "W": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "pop_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Cell west edge (LCC m); from ISRM_SR.W (full 596444, prefix used)."
        },
        "S": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "pop_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Cell south edge (LCC m); from ISRM_SR.S."
        },
        "E": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "pop_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Cell east edge (LCC m); from ISRM_SR.E."
        },
        "N": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "pop_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Cell north edge (LCC m); from ISRM_SR.N."
        },
        "TotalPop": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "pop_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Population per cell; from ISRM_SR.TotalPop (read on the rcv range = [0:52411] prefix slice)."
        },
        "MortalityRate": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "pop_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Baseline mortality per 100k; from ISRM_SR.MortalityRate (prefix [0:52411])."
        },
        "ppl": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "emis_src_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Compact->full source-cell index map: ppl[c] is the full-grid source-cell id (1..52411) of compact emission-bearing cell c. Runner-computed from the LCC projection + rectangle spatial join (np.unique of the joined Location ids), and is the SAME set threaded into the SR provider's lazy select (G2). Used in-model only to gather the compact cell rectangles cell_W/S/E/N."
        },
        "fact": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 28766.639,
          "description": "tons/year emission-unit -> ug/m3 scaling (applied once to the summed concentration)."
        },
        "pop_scale": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1.0465819687408728,
          "description": "Population 2010->2016 rescale."
        },
        "mort_scale": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1.025229357798165,
          "description": "Mortality-rate 2005->2016 rescale."
        },
        "rr_K": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1.06,
          "description": "Krewski relative risk per 10 ug/m3 PM2.5."
        },
        "rr_L": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1.14,
          "description": "Lepeule relative risk per 10 ug/m3 PM2.5."
        },
        "lat_1": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "degree",
          "default": 33.0,
          "description": "LCC standard parallel 1 (NEI2016)."
        },
        "lat_2": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "degree",
          "default": 45.0,
          "description": "LCC standard parallel 2 (NEI2016)."
        },
        "lat_0": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "degree",
          "default": 40.0,
          "description": "LCC origin latitude (NEI2016)."
        },
        "lon_0": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "degree",
          "default": -97.0,
          "description": "LCC central meridian (NEI2016)."
        },
        "lcc_R": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 6370997.0,
          "description": "LCC sphere radius (NEI2016). (Named lcc_R, not R, to avoid the reserved physical-constant name R = ideal gas constant.)"
        },
